        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Character × 4 Scene Explorer\n\nUpload a reference image and generate a 1x4 grid. Select desired image and upscale/refine with Nano Banana Pro. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/templates-split_stack.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": -440
          },
          "width": 600
        }
      },
